"                            Verwaltung durch mich akzeptiert wird. Nutzer, "
"die dieser Regelung nicht\n"
"                            zustimmen möchten, sind eingeladen, die "
"Plattform nicht weiter zu verwenden.\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                            This project is purely a recreational endeavor "
"that serves exclusively for\n"
"                            education and knowledge sharing. The use of the "
"web application\n"
"                            requires acceptance of the processing of "
"personal data as part of its\n"
"                            management by me. Users who do not agree with "
"this policy are invited\n"
"                            to discontinue using the platform.\n"
"                        "

#: root/templates/pages/privacy.html:38
