msgstr "3. Collected Data"

#: root/templates/pages/privacy.html:40
msgid ""
"\n"
"                            Beim unserer Webapplikation werden automatisch "
"Informationen durch den\n"
"                            Webserver in sogenannten Log-Dateien "
"gespeichert. Diese beinhalten die\n"
"                            IP-Adresse, den Browsertyp, das Betriebssystem, "
"die Refferrer-URL,\n"
"                            potenziell teile des Browserverlaufs, sowie das "
"Datum und die Uhrzeit des\n"
"                            Zugriffs. Diese Daten werden nicht "
"weigergegeben.\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                            When using our web application, information is "
"automatically stored\n"
"                            by the web server in so-called log files. These "
"include the\n"
"                            IP address, browser type, operating system, "
"referrer URL,\n"
"                            potentially parts of the browser history, as "
"well as the date and time\n"
"                            of access. This data is not shared.\n"
"                        "

#: root/templates/pages/privacy.html:50
msgid "4. Rechtsgrundlage"
msgstr "4. Legal Basis"

#: root/templates/pages/privacy.html:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"                            Die Verarbeitung der genannten Daten erfolgt "
"gemäss Art. 6 Abs 1 lit. f\n"
"                            DSGVO, wobei unser berechtigtes Interesse darin "
"besteht, eine funktionsfähige\n"
"                            und benutzerfreundliche Webapplikation zu "
"betreiben.\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                            The processing of the mentioned data is carried "
"out in accordance with\n"
"                            Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR, whereby our "
"legitimate interest is to operate\n"
"                            a functional and user-friendly web application.\n"
"                        "

#: root/templates/pages/privacy.html:60
msgid "5. Dauer der Speicherung"
msgstr "5. Storage Duration"

#: root/templates/pages/privacy.html:62
msgid ""
"\n"
"                            Personenbezogene Daten werden nur so lange "
"gespeichert, wie dies für die\n"
"                            Erreichung der hier genannten Zwecken "
"erforderlich ist, jedoch nach einer\n"
"                            Deaktivierung des Kontos, maximal für eine Dauer "
"von 10 Jahre.\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                            Personal data is only stored for as long as it "
"is necessary to\n"
"                            achieve the purposes stated here, but for a "
"maximum duration of\n"
"                            10 years after account deactivation.\n"
